insurance and appointment safety"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"verification-strip","role":"note","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$19:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-shield-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"5 primary sources linked on this page"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Details are reviewed against official programme, university, government or employer information where available. Always reopen the current official call before applying."}]]}]]}],false,false,false,["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-note","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M10.5 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.706.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v6","key":"g5mvt7"}],["path",{"d":"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5","key":"wfsgrz"}],["path",{"d":"m14 20 2 2 4-4","key":"15kota"}]],"className":"lucide-file-check-corner","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Use this guide with the official instructions."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Programme prompts, limits and document rules always take priority over general advice."}]]}]]}],[["$","section","Quick answer: admission comes before the visa appointment",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Quick answer: admission comes before the visa appointment"}],[["$","p","A Pakistani applicant normally chooses a degree, completes the university admission process and then submits the required pre-enrolment request through Universitaly. The university must validate that request before the study-visa appointment route can move forward.",{"children":"A Pakistani applicant normally chooses a degree, completes the university admission process and then submits the required pre-enrolment request through Universitaly. The university must validate that request before the study-visa appointment route can move forward."}],["$","p","The Embassy of Italy in Islamabad stated in its 2026 guidance that validated applicants were contacted through the authorised visa service for appointment allocation. Do not buy an appointment from an agent or rely on an unofficial WhatsApp number.",{"children":"The Embassy of Italy in Islamabad stated in its 2026 guidance that validated applicants were contacted through the authorised visa service for appointment allocation. Do not buy an appointment from an agent or rely on an unofficial WhatsApp number."}]],"$L1e"]}],"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"]]}],"$L25","$L26"]}],"$L27"]}]
